OL,3,GNEWSA'Our son died - now we want safer
OL,4,Acar parks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family is backing a campaign to make
OL,7,Fmulti-storey car parks safer following
OL,8,Fthe death of their son.
OL,10,FAndy and Liz Combeer's 17-year-old son
OL,11,FTom died in the early hours of 8 March
OL,12,F2025 after falling from a multi-storey
OL,13,Fcar park in Guildford. Minutes earlier
OL,14,Fhe had messaged his family's WhatsApp
OL,15,Fgroup saying he loved them.
OL,17,F"If he had walked up to the top of that
OL,18,Fcar park and found that it was
OL,19,Fenclosed, he would still be alive," Liz
OL,20,Ftold the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
